    <h1 class="rv">Send a sketch.<br>Get a <em>production</em> answer.</h1>
    <p class="lead rv">No contract and no call to book. Send a sketch, a reference, or a fit problem you cannot solve &mdash; and I'll come back with what it takes to actually produce it.</p>
