    <h2 class="rv">Three steps, then<br>you have an answer.</h2>
    <div class="steps rv">
      <div><span class="k">Step 01</span><h4>You send it</h4>
        <p>A sketch, a photo, a tech pack, or a description of what's going wrong. Five fields, two minutes.</p></div>
      <div><span class="k">Step 02</span><h4>I read it personally</h4>
        <p>Not a form service, not an assistant. If it isn't something I can help with, I say so the same day.</p></div>
